#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/apriltag_pose/apriltag-pose.rst:48
msgid ""
"*The SDK terms for Pitch, Roll and Yaw are* **not the same** *as the native "
"AprilTag terms, due to the FTC reference frame.*"
msgstr ""
"*The SDK terms for Pitch, Roll and Yaw are* **not the same** *as the native "
"AprilTag terms, due to the FTC reference frame.*"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/apriltag_pose/apriltag-pose.rst:51
msgid ""
"Teams may find it helpful to use a **calculated extension** of the basic "
"pose, with these terms:"
msgstr "チームは、以下の用語を使用して基本的なポーズの **calculated extension** を利用することが役立つかもしれません。"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/apriltag_pose/apriltag-pose.rst:54
msgid "**Range**, direct (point-to-point) distance to the tag center"
msgstr "**Range** 、タグの中心までの直接（ポイントツーポイント）距離"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/apriltag_pose/apriltag-pose.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Bearing**, the angle the camera must turn (left/right) to point directly "
"at the tag center"
msgstr "**Bearing** 、カメラがタグの中心を直接指すために回転させる必要がある角度（左/右）"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/apriltag_pose/apriltag-pose.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Elevation**, the angle the camera must tilt (up/down) to point directly at"
" the tag center"
msgstr "**Elevation** 、カメラがタグの中心を直接指すために傾ける必要がある角度（上/下）"

